          "title": "See where drones fly",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Every phone on the drone feeds shows corridors, routes, sortie circles and drones on its map. A route's name says <strong>Executing</strong> while the drone flies.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2ee5092a068d4bc8.webp",
